    "notes": "<h2>Versions</h2>\n<p><strong>Vector</strong>: <code>1.12.15</code><br>\n<strong>Classic</strong>: <code>0.1.4</code></p>\n\n\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for Classics by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/388</li>\n<li>Updated information on the vector about page by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/392</li>\n<li>Added support for 4-player EMs by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/391</li>\n<li>Player up reporting for EMs by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/402</li>\n<li>added more configs for classics by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/404</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>F14 Switch Matrix fix by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/399</li>\n<li>system 11 game end dither clean up by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/398</li>\n<li>Admin page load harden by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/403</li>\n<li>classics ip display fix by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/406</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Docs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>classics board documentation by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/389</li>\n<li>images for rottendog system11 installation instructions by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/387</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Development:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>HIL: stop the post-flash reset race, bound every mpremote step, un-deprecate the runner by @mullinmax in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/390</li>\n<li>Enable classic boards in HIL bench target resolution by @mullinmax with @Copilot in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/393</li>\n</ul>",
